            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "neofoodie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Took this to a BBQ this past weekend, and it disappeared in under 5 minutes once it hit the table! I doubled it, added bacon and garlic per another review, and it was a hit. Easy and fast, and a nice appetizer option for those of us who don't care for cream cheese or sour cream. Thanks for this great easy recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-06-24T12:30:23.780Z"
