            "reviewBody": "I've made this recipe many times and I love it. The only change I make is to add 1/2 teaspoon of garlic salt or 1/4 teaspoon of garlic powder if I don't want the additional salt. Thanks for your recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2003-10-26T09:43:21.593Z"
